# =================================================================
# AI BRIDGE IGNORE FILE
# =================================================================
# NOTE: Everything in your .gitignore is ALREADY ignored by AI Bridge!
# Do not copy your .gitignore here.
#
# ONLY add files to this list if they are currently tracked by Git,
# but you want to hide them from the AI to save tokens (e.g. huge
# JSON test data, generated code) or to protect sensitive secrets.
# =================================================================
TestResults/
*.g.cs
*.log
*.tmp

/.agents
/dotnet
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
/CONTRIBUTING.md
/LICENSE
/README.md
/SECURITY.md

